#, no-wrap
msgid "The animation below shows the **nutation**: a resonant drive rotates the Bloch vector steadily about the $x$-axis, carrying it from $|0\\rangle$ down toward $|1\\rangle$ and back. This is the very motion the Rabi curve measures.\n"
msgstr "Animasi di bawah menunjukkan **nutasi**: pemacu resonans memutarkan vektor Bloch dengan stabil mengelilingi paksi-$x$, membawanya dari $|0\\rangle$ ke arah $|1\\rangle$ dan kembali. Inilah gerakan yang diukur oleh lengkung Rabi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<IBMVideo id=\"135063678\" title=\"Bloch-sphere animation of Rabi nutation about the x-axis.\"/>\n"
msgstr "<IBMVideo id=\"135063678\" title=\"Animasi sfera Bloch bagi nutasi Rabi mengelilingi paksi-x.\"/>\n"

