msgid "Experiment: $T_1$ (spin-lattice relaxation) {#experiment-t-1-spin-lattice-relaxation}"
msgstr "Eksperimen: $T_1$ (relaksasi spin-kekisi) {#experiment-t-1-spin-lattice-relaxation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Theory {#theory-2}"
msgstr "Teori {#theory-2}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Left alone, an excited spin gives up energy to its surroundings (the \"lattice\") and relaxes back toward thermal equilibrium. The excited-state population decays exponentially with the **spin-lattice relaxation time** $T_1$:\n"
msgstr "Jika dibiarkan, spin teruja melepaskan tenaga kepada persekitarannya (\"kekisi\") dan berehat kembali ke arah keseimbangan terma. Populasi keadaan teruja mereput secara eksponen dengan **masa relaksasi spin-kekisi** $T_1$:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$$P_1(\\tau) = e^{-\\tau/T_1}.$$\n"
msgstr "$$P_1(\\tau) = e^{-\\tau/T_1}.$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a chemist, $T_1$ sets the **recycle delay** you must wait between scans for quantitative NMR, and it reports on **molecular tumbling** and dynamics. On a qubit it is the energy-relaxation time, and is one of the two main numbers used to model the decoherence effects in a quantum computer.\n"
msgstr "Bagi ahli kimia, $T_1$ menentukan **kelewatan kitar semula** yang perlu anda tunggu antara imbasan untuk NMR kuantitatif, dan ia melaporkan tentang **jungkir-balik molekul** serta dinamik. Pada qubit, ia ialah masa relaksasi tenaga, dan merupakan salah satu daripada dua nombor utama yang digunakan untuk memodelkan kesan dekoheren dalam komputer kuantum.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**The experiment.** Prepare $|1\\rangle$ with an $X$ gate (a $\\pi$ pulse), wait a variable delay $\\tau$, then measure. The fraction still in $|1\\rangle$ traces out the decay.\n"
msgstr "**Eksperimen.** Sediakan $|1\\rangle$ dengan get $X$ (denyut $\\pi$), tunggu kelewatan berubah $\\tau$, kemudian ukur. Pecahan yang masih berada dalam $|1\\rangle$ menjejak pereputan itu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "A Bloch-sphere view {#a-bloch-sphere-view-1}"
